---
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";
---

<section class="border-y border-line bg-surface/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-8">
    <SectionHead title="Your work is stuck" muted="in the wrong account.">
      <p>
        AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex hold one login at a time. Switching means logging out and back in,
        and when an account runs out mid-task, the conversation and everything the agent learned about your project stay
        behind with it.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink">
        Handova gives every account its own login, so they all stay signed in, and moves a conversation to whichever one
        you need to keep going.
      </p>
    </SectionHead>
  </div>
</section>
